1
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:07,020
(Howard(on phone):)Okay, Ma.

2
00:00:07,025 --> 00:00:08,695
(Howard(on phone):)Say hi to Aunt Gladys.

3
00:00:08,693 --> 00:00:09,963
(Howard(on phone):)Yeah, I love you,
too.

4
00:00:09,961 --> 00:00:10,961
(Howard(on phone):)Bye.

5
00:00:10,962 --> 00:00:12,792
(Bernadette:)Your mom having fun in Florida?

6
00:00:12,797 --> 00:00:14,127
(Howard:)Mmm, she loves it.

7
00:00:14,132 --> 00:00:16,132
(Howard:)She finally found a place
where everyone talks about

8
00:00:16,134 --> 00:00:17,604
(Howard:)how sweaty they are.

9
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,570
(Howard:)Anyway, she wants us
to go to the house

10
00:00:20,572 --> 00:00:23,742
(Howard:)and check in on Stuart
because he might be "lonely."

11
00:00:23,742 --> 00:00:25,412
(Bernadette:)She's just being nice.

12
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,640
(Howard:)Well, I'm her son, how come
she doesn't send someone

13
00:00:27,646 --> 00:00:29,316
(Howard:)to check on me if I'm lonely?

14
00:00:29,314 --> 00:00:30,614
(Bernadette:)Because you have a wife.

15
00:00:34,386 --> 00:00:37,456
(Howard:)Yeah, well, sometimes
you work late.

16
00:00:37,455 --> 00:00:40,425
(Bernadette:)I know you don't like
Stuart being in the house,

17
00:00:40,425 --> 00:00:41,925
(Bernadette:)but the store's
about to reopen,

18
00:00:41,927 --> 00:00:43,297
(Bernadette:)I'm sure he'll get
back on his feet.

19
00:00:43,295 --> 00:00:44,825
(Howard:)That would be great.

20
00:00:44,829 --> 00:00:47,229
(Howard:)I'd love for things between me
and Mom to get back to normal.

21
00:00:47,232 --> 00:00:50,932
(Bernadette:)Well, normal's a
strong word, but sure.

22
00:00:55,073 --> 00:00:57,473
(Barry:)Hey.
Hello.

23
00:00:57,475 --> 00:00:59,005
(Penny:)You okay?

24
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:01,340
(Sheldon:)If I was okay,
I would've said "hello"

